  "description": "Dong-Hyuk has one go-to hobby: lusting after the beautiful actress Hwa Riae. Others might call it a mid-life crisis since he’s almost 50 now, but who cares? He still thinks she’s the hottest person to ever walk the face of the earth. But he sure wasn’t expecting to meet her in real life… and definitely not as his son’s girlfriend, or just maybe, his future daughter-in-law? Dong-Hyuk tries hard to deny his feelings, but Riae’s even sexier in person. And going by how she looks at him, looks like those sparks aren’t one-sided, either…\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
